:name: AM64x RPMsg POC
:description: ZynqMP stand-in for the AM64x. Linux userspace on the A53 (apu0) talks RPMsg to Zephyr on the R5F (rpu0) over the ZynqMP IPI.

# Run from the repository root after scripts/build_and_run.sh has produced the
# build artifacts. Linux console: uart1. Zephyr console: uart0.

using sysbus
using sysbus.cluster0
using sysbus.cluster1

$name?="AM64x_RPMsg_POC"
mach create $name

machine LoadPlatformDescription @renode/am64_zynqmp.repl
machine SetSerialExecution True

# Renode's ZynqMP_IPI stores whatever is written to an ISR register and only
# clears it when exactly one channel bit is written. Real ISRs are
# write-1-to-clear, and Zephyr's IPI driver clears them all at init by writing
# 0xFFFFFFFF, which would leave every bit set and cause an interrupt storm on
# the first kick. Reduce ISR writes to the bits that are actually pending.
sysbus SetHookBeforePeripheralWrite ipi """
from System import UInt64
if (offset & 0xFFF) == 0x10:
    pending = int(self.ReadDoubleWord(offset)) & int(value)
    if pending & (pending - 1) == 0:
        value = UInt64(pending)
"""

# Built locally (scripts/build_and_run.sh)
$dtb?=      @build/am64_rpmsg_poc.dtb
$rootfs?=   @build/rootfs.ext2
$zephyr?=   @zephyr_app/build/zephyr/zephyr.elf

# Antmicro's ZynqMP OpenAMP demo firmware and kernel (Linux 6.6.10)
$atf_elf?=  @https://dl.antmicro.com/projects/renode/zynq-us_plus--bl31.elf-s_770984-aad9c28d989600caa8fd436bca66eb500e0606dd
$uboot?=    @https://dl.antmicro.com/projects/renode/zynq-us_plus--u-boot.bin-s_1351888-8291c2fd5e7fed3bda101e4c0694991fb40af277
$linux?=    @https://dl.antmicro.com/projects/renode/zynqmp--linux-Image-openamp-s_23429632-e9ff8dd5c5963153dd87791cc250dea3c039cbbc

$bootargs?="earlycon console=ttyPS1,115200n8 root=/dev/ram0 rw initrd=0x20000000,64M uio_pdrv_genirq.of_id=generic-uio"

showAnalyzer uart1
showAnalyzer uart0

macro reset
"""
    apu0 PC 0x1000000
    cluster0 IsHalted true
    apu0 IsHalted false

    cluster1 IsHalted true
    rpu0 IsHalted false

    sysbus LoadELF    $atf_elf cpu=apu0
    sysbus LoadFdt    $dtb    0x100000   $bootargs false context=apu0
    sysbus LoadBinary $uboot  0x8000000  cpu=apu0
    sysbus LoadBinary $linux  0x10000000 cpu=apu0
    sysbus LoadBinary $rootfs 0x20000000 cpu=apu0

    sysbus LoadELF    $zephyr cpu=rpu0
"""

runMacro $reset
